OL,3,GNEWSAMother told to book appointment to
OL,4,Agive birth to baby who had died
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains themes
OL,7,Fand images some readers may find
OL,8,Fupsetting.
OL,10,FA seven-month pregnant woman whose
OL,11,Funborn baby died after she was
OL,12,Fdischarged from hospital while
OL,13,Fsuffering from a life-threatening
OL,14,Fcondition was told by staff to make an
OL,15,Fappointment to give birth.
OL,17,FDanielle Brown, 31, from North
OL,18,FTyneside, said she was devastated to
OL,19,Fhave to return home knowing the baby
OL,20,Fshe was carrying was no longer alive.
